          '',
          'Se arma con \`Breadcrumb\` (\`@/components/ui/breadcrumb\`) y \`SettingsPageHeader\` (\`@/components/settings/SettingsPageHeader\`), que ya usan Accounts, Employees, Locations y Ledger options.',
